# Product

- Grades 1–5, Vietnamese chrome, English lemmas.
- No teacher role. Student auth is username + password cookie.
- Light unit path + stars. Calendar/admin lock only. No hearts. Old units stay playable.
- Student UI on `apps/web` supports both mobile touch and classroom-readable desktop display; same game rules and account flow.
- Follow `docs/PRODUCT.md` and `docs/DATA.md` for metrics and unit lock.
